Numerical simulations of a rotor in confined areas including the presence of wind
Reda Merabet ∗, Eric Laurendeau
Department of Mechanical Engineering, Polytechnique Montréal, Montréal, C.P. 6079, succ. Centre-ville, Montréal (Qc), H3C 3A7, Canada
